  '| AC-3 | `test_absent_name`; `tests/unit/sample_test.txt::test_not_in_file`; `nomatch_*`; `specs/active/0040-map.md` | fast |' \
  '' '## Build evidence' '| AC-9 | `test_outside_the_map` | fast |'
put tests/unit/sample_test.txt 'def test_present_one(): ...' 'def test_in_file(): ...' 'def test_wild_card(): ...' 'def test_param(): ...'
